<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tTransforms into a more vulnerable form after certain period of time (1 minute- 1.5 minutes) along with summoning 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spark%20of%20Destruction\">Spark of Destruction</a>. A eradicator never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tJust attack the boss using Death Damage as much as possible since its stronger to all other elements. During the fight it will constantly change forms and 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spark%20of%20Destruction\">Sparks of Destruction</a> will spawn, requiring the team to retarget the boss and mind the summons. \n</p><p>If the team decides to trap the boss on the northern part of the room, extra care should be taken when leaving because the Sparks will accumulate and may be very dangerous.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 123 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bar\"><img alt=\"Energy Bar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Bar_06e351.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bar\">Energy Bar</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\